{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","y":0.065357372780398992,"x":0.5563909773197816,"w":0.29323308308919271,"h":0.018995492594977459},{"w":0.3293172200520833,"x":0.082547199021584555,"y":0.11579054112448339,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.02296699528838464,"c":1},{"x":0.08270676573344625,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","c":1,"y":0.15406976763353675,"w":0.18609022776285805,"h":0.01463596297323666},{"y":0.18375810283497174,"w":0.73536834716796873,"h":0.025509126249314562,"x":0.082530245718441503,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score. Here is the"},{"c":1,"y":0.20637475870332644,"w":0.18796991984049483,"x":0.08270676907411352,"t":"examiner's comment:","h":0.016097875080489432},{"t":"The candidate explains why s\/he both agrees and disagrees with the statement,","c":1,"w":0.69021530151367183,"h":0.024090805594105924,"y":0.23768251871461976,"x":0.12576355749741983},{"y":0.25544404993489733,"h":0.023596662286781811,"w":0.68076761881510417,"c":1,"x":0.12577908381233072,"t":"meeting the requirements of 'To what extent do you agree or disagree with this"},{"h":0.018995492594977459,"t":"statement?' S\/he singles out two areas of disagreement (food and jobs) and","c":1,"x":0.12593986156111953,"w":0.65601501464843759,"y":0.27462974881141022},{"x":0.12576050703382852,"y":0.29121020498619643,"w":0.72028127034505207,"h":0.023504302644453245,"t":"provides clear examples to support these opinions, then goes on to identify an area","c":1},{"t":"of agreement (TV channels), again providing support and then some development","y":0.3090298241146392,"w":0.71270273844401033,"x":0.12580623818547793,"h":0.022614771983582083,"c":1},{"t":"of the example. Organisation is logical and there is clear progression throughout","y":0.32696693349267592,"x":0.12580511420193516,"c":1,"h":0.022903285177001131,"w":0.69578262329101559},{"t":"the writing. There is a range of cohesive devices, used appropriately [Take for","h":0.025270625382796119,"c":1,"y":0.34378712616444673,"x":0.12575176735566421,"w":0.67522196451822925},{"c":1,"x":0.12768283365151206,"t":"example | Actually | Therefore | Naturally | However | This specific area | From this","y":0.36326721588123967,"w":0.71081293741861984,"h":0.021825204567992196},{"h":0.022812932365108063,"w":0.69394104003906254,"y":0.38001808374803092,"c":1,"t":"point of view | In conclusion]. The range of vocabulary is sufficient to show some","x":0.12575422337718778},{"y":0.39937638495132521,"c":1,"h":0.020480419387375104,"t":"flexibility and precision, as well as less common items and an awareness of style","w":0.69948944091796872,"x":0.12581646787570436},{"t":"and collocation [Complex | list of favourites | fits ... my abilities | specific area |","y":0.41671315955595722,"w":0.67692489624023444,"c":1,"x":0.1258338214556676,"h":0.020540728694918298},{"x":0.12769608297873239,"c":1,"y":0.43449230166565633,"w":0.71077418009440108,"h":0.022104699306156439,"t":"many available channels]. There is only one spelling error [beome], probably a slip"},{"y":0.45181286862780934,"x":0.12767631538333357,"w":0.70893234252929682,"h":0.022180479876241277,"c":1,"t":"of the pen. Control over grammar and punctuation is generally good and there is a"},{"c":1,"w":0.55658640543619797,"t":"variety of complex structures with frequent error-free sentences.","h":0.020601249247770181,"x":0.12582999661809319,"y":0.47101881671023338},{"h":0.02590422375464696,"c":1,"y":0.49458640361361161,"t":"The answer is complex since there are a lot of choices in our life and all of them are different","w":0.72598154703776041,"x":0.0843696948053963},{"w":0.73901748657226562,"x":0.084450112180073519,"c":1,"h":0.024731640345959649,"t":"kinds. In some cases I would say that it is a good thing to have the ability to choose from a wide","y":0.51709608820712083},{"c":1,"h":0.025121392853706737,"x":0.084411419166479221,"y":0.53749203751436203,"t":"variety. Take for example gastronomy. Every single person has different meals on their list of","w":0.71463348388671877},{"w":0.71072113037109386,"c":1,"h":0.022856934026066034,"y":0.55949015207887154,"x":0.08449980155336817,"t":"favourites. Actually if you have a bigger family it is almost impossible to cook something that"},{"t":"everyone would like. Therefore I would say that it is great that you can go to a shopping center and","y":0.57990052579137308,"w":0.75957412719726558,"x":0.084506924898895955,"h":0.022127192018881026,"c":1},{"t":"choose from a dozen different food types. I can always find something that looks delicious.","c":1,"x":0.084586457624016398,"y":0.60173857024369459,"h":0.018995492594977459,"w":0.69548873901367192},{"c":1,"x":0.086327262715288761,"t":"Naturally, there are some people who say that it is against evolution. They claim to say that back in","y":0.62762775305928553,"w":0.75965667724609376,"h":0.023455576211962481},{"c":1,"y":0.64621432007361512,"t":"the old days we had a perfect life when technically everybody was farming. I personally disagree with","x":0.08443451809846314,"w":0.76723576863606768,"h":0.025850615344812145},{"y":0.66612478318921187,"w":0.75028498331705729,"t":"that. I am happy that I could choose a job that fits best to my abilities. I mean no one is the same,","x":0.086297132239001637,"h":0.026464050843189035,"c":1},{"h":0.022914435736072214,"t":"why would we want to do the same? Different kinds of universities give us the opportunity to beome","y":0.68971784203718145,"x":0.0863726892643812,"w":0.76147237141927082,"c":1},{"w":0.41353383382161457,"c":1,"y":0.71366279056128834,"h":0.017502695686649861,"t":"who we are meant to be. We have the right to choose.","x":0.086466165757010938},{"x":0.084423639014390803,"y":0.7355200485512623,"w":0.75600519816080736,"t":"However there is one topic where, according to my opinion, we have too many choices. This specific","h":0.027129198456301906,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.73519632975260418,"h":0.022679082670291728,"t":"area is television. There are hundreds of channels, therefore you can always find something that","x":0.086358196366004919,"y":0.75807139172715698},{"w":0.73545410156249991,"x":0.084366670795612511,"t":"is worth watching. Literally you could sit in your sofa the whole day and watch films. I think that","y":0.77628141606927326,"h":0.027457048719495836,"c":1},{"t":"people doing less outdoor activities are the results of the many available channels. From this point","h":0.024961332774361855,"w":0.75792358398437498,"x":0.086261862230433625,"y":0.79840484277256096,"c":1},{"h":0.02250895896268057,"w":0.40816853841145834,"c":1,"y":0.82144918435779679,"t":"of view I would agree that we have too many choices.","x":0.086303105568516683},{"x":0.086355628782103691,"t":"In conclusion I would say that we can't generally talk about choices since they could be different. In","w":0.76153279622395831,"y":0.84816421225825001,"h":0.022650641928314785,"c":1},{"y":0.86805368086956325,"x":0.08633319994458645,"w":0.75587488810221359,"c":1,"h":0.02369996984006506,"t":"some cases it is good to have many of them while in other areas they could have a negative effect."},{"h":0.013081395234588733,"w":0.035714286168416431,"x":0.81766917261128047,"y":0.93750000001864953,"c":1,"t":"129"}]}